<title>USA: IVI Publishing Inc Q4 shr loss widens.</title>
<headline>IVI Publishing Inc Q4 shr loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In Thousands)</p>
<p>			     Three Months Ended    Year Ended</p>
<p>				  December 31	  December 31</p>
<p>				   1996     1995     1996	  1995</p>
<p> Net revenues	     $2,467   $5,011    $9,470     $11,970</p>
<p> Net loss		  (2,072)    (996)  (10,157)    (14,234)</p>
<p>Preferred stock</p>
<p>  dividends		   (30)     (20)     (119)	  (20)</p>
<p> Preferred stock accretion  (15)		 (60)</p>
<p>Net loss applicable to</p>
<p> common stock	  ( 2,117)  ( 1,016)  ( 10,336)  ( 14,254)</p>
<p>Net loss per common</p>
<p>  share		    ( 0.28)  ( 0.13)   ( 1.36)     ( 1.90)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 Q4 includes arbitration award against the</p>
<p>company of $289,000 plus costs, taken as a charge. IVI</p>
<p>Publishing said it believes this amount eventually will be</p>
<p>reduced in the court confirmation process.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
